ues/120000","id":4619354909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE1XDHQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T05:45:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T05:45:45Z","body":"Ahhh good point. Looks like if we use UASTC we would have to decompress to raw and then compress to get ETC2/S3TC which is not ideal. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4619354909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620624620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120000#issuecomment-4620624620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120000","id":4620624620,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE2ki7A","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T09:00:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T09:00:31Z","body":"> Note: Looking at the surrounding code, I see other questionable format choices, like preferring DXT1 over DXT4 for single channel data. BC4 has the same compression ratio as DXT1 except it looks almost indistinguishable from uncompressed (whereas DXT1 looks horrible)\n\nBC4 is actually the primary preferred one, BC1 is only used as a fallback in case RGTC is not supported (probably not possible, but handled just in case for OpenGL/WebGL)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620624620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4633888437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120000#issuecomment-4633888437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120000","id":4633888437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFDOGtQ","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0